# This (PRIVATE) repository tracks the tool's CODE plus the methodology + reference-report
# MARKDOWN corpus for all three agencies (added 2026-10-02 so a clone has the full library).
#
# Still NOT version-controlled: case data under Companies/, the Knowledge Base/, generated
# workbooks, ALL PDFs, the 5+ GB model under models/, and caches. For a PUBLIC/open-source
# export that also strips the third-party corpus, use tools/make_public.py.
#
# Strategy: ignore everything at the root, then re-include only the code paths. This is
# a whitelist on purpose - a new top-level data folder is excluded by default, never
# committed by accident.

/*

# --- re-included: the tool's own code and config ---
!/.gitignore
!/CLAUDE.md
!/UNIFIED_RATING_GUIDE.md
!/webapp/
!/tools/
!/.claude/

# --- authored knowledge: conventions files + Docs (added on request) ---
# Only the project's OWN authored documents are re-included; the agencies' copyrighted
# corpus and corpus dumps/scratch stay out.
# --- the three agency folders, symmetric since ICRA moved out of the root into ICRA/ on
#     2026-10-02. Re-include each agency's authored top-level .md (conventions, README) AND its
#     Methodology/ + Report for Reference/ MARKDOWN corpus (user decision 2026-10-02 - this is a
#     PRIVATE repo; the corpus is .md only, and *.pdf is excluded globally below). The Knowledge
#     Base/ and case data under Companies/ are still NOT tracked.
!/ICRA/
/ICRA/*
!/ICRA/*.md
!/ICRA/Methodology/
!/ICRA/Report for Reference/
!/CRISIL/
/CRISIL/*
!/CRISIL/*.md
!/CRISIL/Methodology/
!/CRISIL/Report for Reference/
!/CareEdge/
/CareEdge/*
!/CareEdge/*.md
!/CareEdge/Methodology/
!/CareEdge/Report for Reference/

# Docs/ is mostly authored analysis, but holds a corpus dump, concatenated corpus
# chunks and scratch that must stay out.
!/Docs/
/Docs/careedge_corpus.json
/Docs/corpus_review/merged/
/Docs/corpus_review/tmp_findings_icra/
/Docs/corpus_review/tmp_findings_ce1/

# --- within the tracked trees, still drop caches, machine-local prefs, logs and secrets ---
__pycache__/
*.pyc
*.pyo
*.log
*.pdf
/webapp/ui_prefs.json
/.claude/settings.local.json
